        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage JH Series Dummy Paris Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe beautiful scalloped mounts of Schlage's Paris Dummy Handleset are perfect matches to traditional decor. It is a grade 3 entrance door pull and deadbolt. The two-piece design offers flexibility for doors with nonstandard hole locations while providing a subtle classic appearance for entranceways. Available in 4 finishes and with 4 inside trim choices so you'll be sure to find just the right combination to suits your tastes. A dummy handleset it is non-functional meaning that it does not latch or lock.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDummy Handlesets are for looks only. They do not lock and do not latch. They are most often used as a pull or to match trim.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/paris-single-cylinder-handleset-schlage-jh60prs\"><b>Paris Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Dexter Paris Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc-based material plated to match the finish you choose.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door preparations.</li>\r\n<li>5 year finish warranty.</li>\r\n<li>25 year mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage Paris Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center of Bore Hole to Bottom Screw: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Handleset Projection: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDummy cylinder handleset is non-functional. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
