                "title": "Paris Dummy Handleset, Schlage JH193PRS",
                "description": "Schlage JH193PRS Dexter Paris Handleset - The beautiful scalloped mounts of Schlage's Paris Dummy Handleset are perfect matches to traditional decor. It is a grade 3 entrance door pull and deadbolt. The two-piece design offers flexibility for doors with nonstandard hole locations while providing a subtle classic appearance for entranceways. Available in 4 finishes and with 4 inside trim choices so you'll be sure to find just the right combination to suits your tastes. A dummy handleset it is non-functional meaning that it does not latch or lock.",
